+ * u16 body length, body. The service answers every request with type + 1 on the same
+ * connection, one request at a time. Replies carry no correlation id, so requests are
+ * serialised here (m_RequestLock) and the single reader thread hands every received frame to
+ * the handler of the request in flight.
